Markup is a fixed bottom sheet (position:fixed; inset-inline:0; bottom:0) with the arrow CSS-animated toward Safari's share control:
@keyframes point{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(6px)}} .a2hs-arrow{animation:point 1s ease-in-out infinite}
Show it delayed (after ~15s or after they scroll one section) so it doesn't blanket the hero. Use navigator.standalone to also hide the Android install chip and any 'installed' UI. Keep copy bilingual and mirror the layout under [dir=rtl] (arrow flips with the RTL flow automatically if you use logical properties).

